{% if result.error %}- Error: {{ result.error }}{% endif %}
{% if result.duration_ms %}- Duration: {{ result.duration_ms }}ms{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

## FAILED ACTIONS
{% for action in failed_actions %}
- {{ action.type }} → {{ action.target }}: {{ action.error | default('Unknown error') }}
